    "Optional. Without a key, only the on-device NLP signals above are used — still effective for most duplicates. With a key, borderline matches (rule score %lld–%lld) are escalated to the selected Claude model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Optional. Without a key, only the on-device NLP signals above are used — still effective for most duplicates. With a key, borderline matches (rule score %1$lld–%2$lld) are escalated to the selected Claude model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选用。未填密钥时只会使用上方的本机 NLP 信号 — 对多数重复项仍然有效。填入密钥后,难以判定的配对(规则评分 %1$lld–%2$lld)会交由所选的 Claude 模型判断。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選用。未填密鑰時只會使用上方的本機 NLP 訊號 — 對多數重複項仍然有效。填入密鑰後,難以判定的配對(規則評分 %1$lld–%2$lld)會交由所選的 Claude 模型判斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
