    "The cloud tier is called only for ambiguous pairs — never for high-confidence matches or when you're offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有在配对难以判定时才会呼叫云端 — 高信心配对或离线时都不会呼叫。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有在配對難以判定時才會呼叫雲端 — 高信心配對或離線時都不會呼叫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The interface language changes after the app restarts.": {
      "localizations": {
