            "value": "主題"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These contacts appear to be the same person. Please confirm how to handle them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些联系人看起来是同一个人。请确认要如何处理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些聯絡人看起來是同一個人。請確認要如何處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These run instantly on-device with no network access required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些完全在装置上即时执行,不需要网络。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些完全在裝置上即時執行,不需要網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These safeguards are recommended. Disabling them speeds up sync but increases the risk of data loss.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议保留这些防护。关闭可加快同步,但会提高数据遗失的风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建議保留這些防護。關閉可加快同步,但會提高資料遺失的風險。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears the recorded activity log only. Your backups and contacts are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这只会清除活动记录，你的备份与联系人不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這只會清除活動記錄，你的備份與聯絡人不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This contact has no previous versions": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
